<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Lithium - DEMO</title><link>https://example.com/mining-brief-demo</link><description>SYNTHETIC demo feed</description><item><title>[示例] Lithium carbonate futures in focus (sample)</title><link>https://example.com/mining-brief-demo/lithium-carbonate-futures-in-focus--sample/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>[示例] Lithium carbonate futures in focus (sample): synthetic lithium story used by offline demos.</description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This page is synthetic demo content generated for offline runs and tests of the mining brief agent. It imitates the layout of a mining news article so that the extraction pipeline has realistic structure to work with, but it does not report real events and must not be read as news. [示例] Lithium carbonate futures in focus (sample): synthetic lithium story used by offline demos. The paragraph continues with neutral filler about how analysts usually compare production guidance, resource estimates and benchmark prices when they review a lithium project, and how they record the source of every number they quote. A second paragraph explains that the offline dataset is regenerated by a script, so its contents are stable across test runs and contain no third-party text. A third paragraph exists only to give the article enough length for the extractor to treat it as the main body.</p>]]></content:encoded><category>Battery Metals</category></item><item><title>[示例] Spodumene concentrate shipments overview (sample)</title><link>https://example.com/mining-brief-demo/spodumene-concentrate-shipments-overview--sample/</link><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>[示例] Spodumene concentrate shipments overview (sample): synthetic lithium story used by offline demos.</description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This page is synthetic demo content generated for off